  "description": "Router container Loki logs (compose service router only; no node-agent). Alloy promotes the level stream label; node, reason, path, request_class, request_id, and timestamp are JSON fields \u2014 queries use | json, not invented Loki labels. line_format is allowlisted fields only (no prompt, messages, body, embeddings, tokens, Authorization, or secrets). All / .* is match-all; label_format treats missing JSON fields as empty so All does not hide lines that omit node or reason. Alloy sensitive_keys drop counts are not in Loki \u2014 do not fake them here.",
